  "notes": "Ordenanza 03-2013 set primary and secondary at six years each, both split into two three-year cycles (1ro–3ro, 4to–6to). It replaced Básica (8 years) + Media (4 years); the old names (7mo/8vo grado, 1ro–4to de bachillerato) are kept as aliases. From 4to de secundaria learners follow the academic, technical-professional or arts track. The MINERD website was unreachable from our network."
